<title>USA: Digital Video names Parkinson president.</title>
<headline>Digital Video names Parkinson president.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Video Systems Inc said it named Thomas Parkinson president and to the new post of chief operating officer. He replaces Robert Pfannkuch as president.</p>
<p>Pfannkuch will continue to serve as chairman of the executive committee of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Parkinson joins Digital Video from Shape Inc, a maker of data, video and optical discs, cartridges and cassettes, where he served as president and chief executive officer.</p>
